WEBVTT

01:46.104 --> 01:47.694
What is this?

01:47.904 --> 01:49.874
What's happened?

01:55.174 --> 01:58.874
Something reached for but cannot be grasped...

01:59.684 --> 02:03.674
Something that strays from that hand,
going far away...

02:04.984 --> 02:09.284
People will always pursue such things.

02:10.394 --> 02:14.024
And before long, become lost.

02:19.904 --> 02:24.304
This is our story of one such summer.

02:42.654 --> 02:44.094
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

02:44.094 --> 02:47.764
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow
Asphalt ni saita

02:47.764 --> 02:48.194
Living for the Day
After Tomorrow

02:48.534 --> 02:52.194
Kodomo no rakugaki ga

02:52.964 --> 02:56.594
Kagerou ni yurarete

02:57.444 --> 03:00.274
Arukidashita

03:00.414 --> 03:05.244
Daremo shiranai yakusoku no

03:05.244 --> 03:08.874
Oka de meguriau

03:09.414 --> 03:14.124
Tatta ichido no kyou to iu

03:14.124 --> 03:18.894
Kiseki no toki wo kanjite

03:18.894 --> 03:23.064
Nagareru kumo oikakete

03:23.064 --> 03:27.404
Imanimo tsukamesou na

03:27.404 --> 03:31.774
Mune no yokan takanari

03:31.774 --> 03:36.404
Ugokihajimeta unmei

03:36.514 --> 03:40.884
Me ga sameru hodo mabushii

03:40.884 --> 03:44.914
Asa no hi yorimo atatakai

03:45.154 --> 03:49.054
Owari no nai kagayaku

03:49.394 --> 03:56.694
Hikari no kisetsu ni dakarete

03:59.164 --> 04:03.294
A Passing Encounter

04:06.674 --> 04:08.774
Yeah. No...

04:08.774 --> 04:12.314
I thought she might have told you something,
Tetsu, so I gave you a call.

04:12.314 --> 04:17.614
I mean, tomorrow's a school day,
so I wondered if you two had made plans or...

04:18.124 --> 04:18.984
Oh...

04:20.254 --> 04:24.284
Uh, Karada's out right now.

04:25.564 --> 04:28.064
No, everything's fine!

04:28.064 --> 04:30.224
All right. Sorry to bother you.

04:40.844 --> 04:43.364
Where the heck is she?

05:41.834 --> 05:43.234
Karada...

05:45.574 --> 05:47.734
You're Karada.

05:50.884 --> 05:52.784
It's me, Shoko.

05:52.784 --> 05:53.904
Shoko Nogami.

05:56.054 --> 05:57.344
It's a lie!

05:58.124 --> 06:00.424
We were together just a moment ago, yes?

06:00.424 --> 06:02.254
I'm your brother's friend...

06:02.254 --> 06:04.994
It's a lie... a lie...

06:04.994 --> 06:06.124
A lie...

06:06.124 --> 06:07.494
A lie!

06:08.634 --> 06:11.324
Miss Shoko is a grown-up!

06:36.854 --> 06:39.324
Honestly... I swear.

06:42.064 --> 06:43.294
Here.

06:46.834 --> 06:51.004
If you come back to my apartment,
we can at least get you something to wear.

06:51.004 --> 06:53.334
Staying here like this won't accomplish anything.

07:12.324 --> 07:13.554
For crying out loud...

07:58.504 --> 08:01.134
This... isn't me.

08:04.784 --> 08:06.744
Hiro
lokawa

08:39.314 --> 08:40.444
Huh?

08:44.024 --> 08:48.784
The phone you have dialed is outside our
service area or has not been recharged.

08:48.924 --> 08:50.514
Your call could not be completed.

08:50.894 --> 08:53.794
The phone you have dialed
is outside our service area...

08:57.604 --> 08:59.894
The last train is now departing.

09:07.444 --> 09:10.314
I shouldn't have made her go home alone.

09:28.194 --> 09:31.394
How could I even explain this to him?

09:46.644 --> 09:49.114
No clothes for me, huh?

10:05.804 --> 10:07.294
This isn't me.

10:08.974 --> 10:11.204
This body isn't me!

10:16.874 --> 10:19.504
I'll put a change of clothes for you here.

10:45.474 --> 10:48.444
Why did this happen?

11:12.334 --> 11:14.394
Where on Earth did she go?

11:19.004 --> 11:20.974
Aaah, I didn't do my homework!

11:20.974 --> 11:21.614
Me neither!

11:21.614 --> 11:22.174
Hey, so, did you go anywhere?
Me neither!

11:22.174 --> 11:22.944
Hey, so, did you go anywhere?

11:22.944 --> 11:24.184
To my grandma's house.

11:24.184 --> 11:25.944
It's a school day.

11:26.784 --> 11:27.974
Tomorrow.

11:32.254 --> 11:34.014
She didn't even come...

12:27.744 --> 12:29.714
Morning, Karada.

12:29.974 --> 12:31.644
Good morning.

12:36.014 --> 12:38.414
It wasn't a dream, was it?

12:39.284 --> 12:40.344
Hello!

12:41.494 --> 12:44.054
Hello! Is anyone home?

12:46.964 --> 12:48.754
That's strange...

12:50.834 --> 12:52.164
Huh?

12:53.134 --> 12:56.864
Hello! Is anyone home?

13:00.544 --> 13:05.074
Yes. Her fever's gone down quite a bit,
but she's still...

13:05.444 --> 13:08.574
So I wanted to keep her home
from school today.

13:08.914 --> 13:10.474
Sorry for the bother.

13:16.454 --> 13:17.324
Karada!

13:17.324 --> 13:18.294
Iokawa?!

13:20.124 --> 13:21.754
Oh, Jeez...

13:24.304 --> 13:25.694
U-um!

13:29.874 --> 13:34.744
Uh, is lokawa... I mean, is Karada all right?

13:35.244 --> 13:36.374
Can I help you with something?

13:36.374 --> 13:40.514
Well, she didn't come to school and
she's not home so I wondered what-

13:40.514 --> 13:41.914
YOU wondered?

13:46.254 --> 13:47.554
I'm the one who wants to know.

13:53.094 --> 13:54.564
Was that all?

13:54.564 --> 13:59.704
Uh, I brought this printout of contact info.
From school...

13:59.704 --> 14:01.574
Just set it down there somewhere.

14:01.574 --> 14:05.004
Um, what about lokawa?

14:05.174 --> 14:07.004
Thanks for the printout.

14:07.004 --> 14:09.014
I have some errands to run. Goodbye.

14:09.014 --> 14:10.544
H-hey!

14:10.544 --> 14:12.604
Did something happen to lokawa?!

14:24.824 --> 14:27.924
Karada? Do you want something to drink?

14:29.234 --> 14:30.854
Are you hungry?

14:32.034 --> 14:33.794
Should I make something?

14:35.134 --> 14:36.904
Is there anything you want to eat?

14:48.684 --> 14:50.654
It's hot, isn't it?

14:51.324 --> 14:53.044
I'll open a window.

15:18.914 --> 15:20.984
The breeze feels good, doesn't it?

15:20.984 --> 15:23.674
With weather like this, you don't have
to use the air conditioner much.

15:25.754 --> 15:27.654
I like this view, too.

15:28.924 --> 15:32.824
I chose this apartment when I saw the view.

15:36.294 --> 15:38.194
Just look at those streets...

15:52.414 --> 15:54.574
Talk about a couple of scary faces.

15:56.014 --> 15:58.044
It's not polite to stare.

15:58.454 --> 16:00.054
Yeah, I know!

16:00.054 --> 16:03.954
So, Karada never came home last night?

16:03.954 --> 16:05.294
Huh?

16:05.294 --> 16:06.994
Is that what you called about?

16:06.994 --> 16:08.394
Y-yeah.

16:08.394 --> 16:10.064
I knew it!

16:10.064 --> 16:11.734
If that's the case, you should've
said so right from the...

16:11.734 --> 16:13.594
Hey, keep your voice down!

16:14.004 --> 16:15.064
O-okay.

16:15.774 --> 16:18.144
Do you have any ideas?

16:18.144 --> 16:23.374
I've gone everywhere I can think of,
and called all the places she might...

16:28.084 --> 16:29.554
Redial
Aug 711:05pm
Shoko Nogami
Aug 711:03pm
Shoko Nogami

16:39.464 --> 16:42.324
So these stones make wishes come true?

16:47.504 --> 16:48.994
Is everything all right?

16:49.574 --> 16:51.234
I made a wish there!

16:51.904 --> 16:54.804
I... I made my wish there!

16:58.784 --> 17:00.474
H-hey!

17:02.254 --> 17:04.084
What's that all about?

17:15.294 --> 17:20.034
The phone you have dialed is outside
our service area or has not been recharged.

17:22.734 --> 17:24.964
I never asked for her address...

17:32.544 --> 17:33.844
Oh.

17:34.144 --> 17:36.544
That place she's been going to recently!

17:37.314 --> 17:38.254
See you!

17:39.024 --> 17:39.924
Hey!

17:39.924 --> 17:43.754
It's 6:30. You need to go home.

17:43.754 --> 17:45.494
C'mon, cut me some slack!

17:45.494 --> 17:48.864
No way. I'll be the one who gets yelled at!

17:48.864 --> 17:52.634
Being the only one can come and go
as you please is really unfair!

17:53.034 --> 17:54.404
Well excuse me.

18:12.354 --> 18:13.714
Karada...

18:14.454 --> 18:15.924
The stones...

18:20.994 --> 18:23.194
They've turned to coal?

18:23.194 --> 18:25.664
Because my wish was granted.

18:28.874 --> 18:31.164
They granted my wish...

18:33.774 --> 18:36.144
...and now they're broken.

18:37.984 --> 18:41.104
I'm sorry. It was my wish.

18:41.254 --> 18:43.084
"Make me an adult," I thought.

18:43.214 --> 18:48.344
I wanted to hurry up and be an adult
so I could let Hiro be free, right now.

18:52.724 --> 18:58.224
I've always, always been a burden for him.

19:15.314 --> 19:17.974
As of today, this is our new apartment.

19:24.324 --> 19:25.384
Look.

19:28.434 --> 19:30.024
Thank you so much!

19:35.134 --> 19:37.104
You'll get bigger soon.

19:37.104 --> 19:38.764
Yes, you're right.

19:49.814 --> 19:52.984
It's all right. I'll be bigger soon.

19:53.524 --> 19:55.194
Welcome!
To
Kanocho

19:55.194 --> 19:59.594
Welcome!
To
Kanocho
Hiro has always made sacrifices for me.

19:59.594 --> 19:59.854
Welcome!
To
Kanocho

19:59.924 --> 20:03.264
He didn't have to have been so kind to me...

20:04.194 --> 20:08.104
But all these years, just for me, he's always...

20:09.204 --> 20:10.794
That's why I made my wish.

20:10.934 --> 20:14.964
To become an adult and let Hiro be free.

20:18.514 --> 20:22.614
The wishing stones heard my wish.

20:24.254 --> 20:25.844
I'm sorry.

21:04.664 --> 21:05.564
Um...

21:05.564 --> 21:08.124
Sorry. I didn't mean to intrude.

21:29.514 --> 21:31.744
What do I do, Miss Shoko?

21:32.884 --> 21:37.794
Hiro... didn't even recognize me!

21:42.664 --> 21:45.094
Of course he didn't recognize her.

21:45.734 --> 21:49.564
There's no reason he would.

22:13.964 --> 22:20.204
Narenai kutsu wo haita

22:20.204 --> 22:24.934
Ippozutsu taeru itami

22:26.374 --> 22:32.644
Soredemo aruku no wa

22:32.644 --> 22:37.444
Kaeru basho ga aru kara

22:38.224 --> 22:46.364
Watashi ga watashi wo mitsumete

22:46.364 --> 22:50.954
Kizuita wasuremono

22:54.104 --> 23:00.274
Anato to issho ni itai

23:00.274 --> 23:06.984
Chikaku de, tooku de kanjitai yo

23:06.984 --> 23:12.854
Atarimae no mainichi

23:12.854 --> 23:19.494
Itoshii anato to tsukuritsuzukeru

23:19.494 --> 23:26.924
"Tadaima" to kutsu wo nuide, dakishimeru

23:27.164 --> 23:32.004
My sweet home

23:43.784 --> 23:48.414
Of course no one would understand.
I can't even believe it myself.

23:48.894 --> 23:51.954
That her wish would result in this...

23:52.294 --> 23:56.164
But why? Why have I taken this form?

23:56.864 --> 24:00.234
I didn't wish for this. To return to childhood...

24:00.634 --> 24:03.904
To turn back the hands of time...

24:04.274 --> 24:07.004
Next time, on Living for the Day After Tomorrow:

24:07.004 --> 24:08.974
Next episode
A New Lifestyle
"A New Lifestyle"

24:08.974 --> 24:11.744
